probe_nh_rohf: NH triplet ROHF/6-31G, 1 frozen core, active MOs 2-11. Geometry
and basis match the nh_rohf fixture. A second open shell, and one that differs
from CH2 where it counts: the two singly occupied orbitals are a degenerate pi
pair, so any orbital-ordering assumption that happens to hold for CH2 gets a
second, harder test.

